{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_tknogi_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_tknogi_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"尋常夕陽","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tknogi_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"85b74e0f479edcdb8c22db70cb164d7ca55908dc44c34e74840d084991aaab77","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"天災過後，一名畫家的理想破滅。本該離去的月禾上門拜訪，她將告訴他可以走向何方。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那裡！我的房間就在那裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們能不能再開快一點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"天災已經很近了，先生，請抓緊時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要催我！我自己佈置的房間，備用畫具放在哪裡我一清二楚，拿上我們就走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在那櫃子下面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不見了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就放在這裡的！怎麼會不見？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，那些人那麼著急逃跑嗎？竟然撞倒我的畫具！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"破壞了偉大的創作！一群罪人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您先冷靜，這屋裡還有其他人住嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人......房東佩里太太，一個對藝術毫無認知的主婦，能把落日認成油鍋裡的煎蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"和名單確認一下，看是否成功撤離了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幾乎沒和她說過話，不記得有沒有她的聯繫方式......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"德夫林先生，您的通訊設備裡有新訊息！給！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“德夫林先生，天災危急，由於您不在屋裡，我將您的物品打包進了門口的行李箱中，您回來以後可以直接帶去避難......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“祝福您一路順利——佩里。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝天謝地！感謝您，善心的女士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"是這個行李箱嗎？我拿上車了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝天謝地，我還能在車上作畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"快走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們往那邊去點，留給我作畫的空間！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您這樣很容易掉下車去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦，不，不要！我的畫具！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對藝術一竅不通的蠢女人，你都做了些什麼啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畫布髒了，畫筆浸泡在了顏料裡，顏料也......全部混在了一起！這樣根本沒法用了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一幅畫，以後您還有機會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......沒有了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......苦苦追尋天災那麼久，全都是為了這一刻，能將這幅無上瑰麗的景象，以我的畫筆親手在畫布上描繪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的畫，我的夢，我的生活，我的一切......全都毀了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別來煩我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，別來煩我，聽不到嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這都幾點了？太陽都落山了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要什麼心理疏導，我又沒死！你們有完沒完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一次。我警告你們，要是再煩我，休怪我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼......是你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，德夫林先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......晚上好，我記得你，你是那天預警天災的......我想想......什麼島的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島，我是羅德島的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？沒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"初次見面時我就做過自我介紹了哦。哎呀，您該不會忘記一路上陪伴著您的女士的名字吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎......怎麼可能？你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"月禾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我給您留下的印象還不壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，言歸正傳。抱歉耽誤您休息的時間，有幾個問題想要問您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您的身體感覺好些了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......托你們的福，本來就沒什麼大礙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就放心了。精神上呢，您有感覺到什麼不適嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就那樣，我的畫已經畫不成了，還能差到哪裡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣呀，那您在安置點有什麼生活上的困難嗎？您似乎拒絕了所有上門拜訪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"困難......我希望那些“好心”的鄰居能少來煩我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想做登記，對“災後心靈互助會”的活動不感興趣，沒心情見到任何人的苦瓜臉，更不喜歡被堵在門口回答沒必要的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的問題問完了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您需要的話，隨時都可以結束哦。我不希望讓您感到不適。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們這些天災信使，不是天災一結束就連影子都見不到了嗎？你怎麼還留在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您見過其他天災信使嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒......沒有，我在書裡讀到過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"天災信使也有很多種，有的天災信使會關注一些職責範圍之外的事，有的......呵呵，乾脆就不做天災信使了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"而我，留下來當然也有我的理由，比方說，我關心您的情況......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別開玩笑了，你們還是多關注一下其他人吧，每天晚上外面的哭聲都很嚇人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"只是理由之一，您當然也可以認為我是留戀風景而駐足於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，這附近確實有不少值得一看的景色，有一處山丘的黃昏景致十分動人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"若是師從萊塔尼亞首屈一指的風景畫大師萊昂......青年成名，立誓終身追逐光影的優秀畫家，也許有興趣移步欣賞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你調查過我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"只是作為一名繪畫愛好者，對優秀的畫家都略有耳聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您離開萊塔尼亞前留下的那幅風景畫，用細密的筆觸捉住了夕陽消逝的瞬間，可真讓人印象深刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幅垃圾......它永遠比不上天災的美麗，沒什麼比得上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"即使不以作畫為目的，於美景中散心也有助於排解煩惱。倘若您有興趣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不去，也不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，月禾小姐，我感謝你和你的同事帶我避開天災，但我的畫被毀了也是事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們當時能夠再快一點，兇狠一點，趕走那些攔路打劫的暴民——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定我就能趕在佩里太太打包之前回到家，我的畫具也就不會不能用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此，我不需要你們的關心。你們做其他任何想做的事都好，就記住一點，別來煩我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"月禾小姐，希望這是我最後一次見到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"不論如何，很高興認識您，德夫林先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，在離開之前，我還有一份東西要贈與您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"不成敬意，也並非為了工作。只是作為一個繪畫愛好者，來自我本人的一點小心意，願您能收下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼我就放在這裡了，祝您今夜好夢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"空白的畫布上不著色彩，只有影子。\n他久久凝視著，凝視著陰影搖曳的邊緣。\n在那裡，光與影如混沌般破碎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，他猛地揮拳，畫板應聲倒地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畫不出來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，我畫不出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如天災那般......盛大的，輝煌的，美妙的......光與影的音符，色彩的協奏......不會再有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你連拿起畫筆都做不到......還有什麼可畫的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禮物......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畫具、顏料，一看就是為補償我留下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然知道我只用這個牌子的顏料，我應該沒有對外提起過......她是根據畫的顏料質地推斷出來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜......沒什麼有價值的東西。我就不該期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這是......東國的木版畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然是風景畫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從未見過的技法......線條不錯，表現力十足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大膽的色彩處理，簡直是離經叛道......但呈現的效果頗有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼處理未嘗不是一種思路......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜深了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些晚上，外面的哭聲少了很多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次給我畫的那個女人......她還留在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在忙！等一會！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了！別敲了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說了我不去你們舉辦的什麼“搬遷節”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，德夫林先生，又見面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您的心情好一些了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您的氣色看上去比之前好了不少，想必睡得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼還來我這裡？我都那麼說了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，提起女士的傷心事可不好哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛在門外聽見您說在忙，在忙著畫畫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘗試些新的技法罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"真是不錯的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我不是來問您問題的，是有些東西帶給您。您看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，黃昏時我從那片山丘上採來的，還沾著露水呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很普通，顏色單調，造型也未經修剪......這樣缺乏美感的東西並不能對我有什麼幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"這些花兒不是送給您觀賞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我拿來是想要拜託您幫我畫一幅這束花的靜物畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼可能畫這樣的俗物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"那幾幅東國的版畫，您還喜歡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我在東國長大，小時候和家裡人下山去居城時，總是看到很多畫師圍在邸宅的大門前，搶著把自己的作品獻給當地的大人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"得益於此，我見到了不少綺麗的名畫，在賞畫一途上，勉強摸到些門道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"離開東國前，我挑了幾幅畫作帶在身上，本想獨自一人時欣賞，但又覺得有些乏味。要是它們有機會能幫到需要的人，那就再好不過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您說是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......把花給我，我畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"既然是我拜託您作畫，那花的造型也由我來佈置比較好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屋裡很亂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"外面真冷呀，您確定還要繼續在這裡聊天嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......進來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......就像您說的，的確不甚整潔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎沒有能擺下花的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發放了很多沒用的物資，我不想花時間收拾，反正也是臨時的住處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不行，舒適的環境能讓人更安心，畫畫是一項需要靜心的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......我來幫您整理屋子吧，就當是為了完成一幅更好的畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒有必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"先從哪邊開始呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這裡都堆放了些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個放著別動，我來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"二十分鐘後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜託你，那堆稿紙就放那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您看，沒花多少時間就已經收拾完了。這樣的環境才有生活氣息嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真麻煩，啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畫板的朝向，架子的高度，還有那束花......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"那天隨您一起去的時候，我見過了您的房間，收拾得很有條理呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我是按照印象還原的佈置，可惜牆上那幅描繪花的靜物畫您沒有帶走，我就把帶來的花擺在那裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有哪裡讓您感到不舒服吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有......和天災之前......很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天晚上我練習回來，打開燈，在我面前的就是這幅景象。有時候佩里太太會在樓下煮肉湯，氣味會順著窗子飄進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管我從沒吃過，但......感覺很溫暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"希望能讓您感到舒適。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"不過那堆畫稿......我先前沒有在您的房間中見到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來將它們交給了佩里太太，希望她可以處理掉，但沒想到她幫我打包進了行李箱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，正是為了把這些廢稿塞進去，才弄壞了我的畫具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我能看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，隨意吧，反正都是寫生練習的廢稿，一些沒用的垃圾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢？這些風景畫都很美麗，山麓，海崖，草地......還有黃昏的斜陽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩里太太大概也是像你這樣，覺得這幾幅畫看起來像模像樣才打包起來，結果壞了我的大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"並不是的。這些畫中有很多黃昏的景色，對夕陽的刻畫極為出色，水準已經超過了您留在學院的那一幅畫作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不值一提。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......應當見過很多次天災吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就該明白，什麼朝霞，什麼黃昏......這片大地上的任何風景，在天災面前都黯然失色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時在萊塔尼亞，我明明開創了前所未有的技法，以最美麗的方式組合色彩，將光影的瞬間完美映入畫中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些傢伙卻說不應該這麼做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不夠細膩，毫不雅致......他們就以這些可笑的理由將我的畫拒之門外，不允許我參加畫展。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以為是我的畫技還不夠好，於是拼命提高自己。對我來說，只要能得到萊昂老師的認可，一切批評都無所謂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我終於完成了一幅美妙的黃昏風景畫，但你知道當我把那幅畫拿到他面前時，他說了什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說：“現在你的畫無法打動我。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來，我想通了，不是我的畫技有問題，或許我就不該畫這種畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，昨天見到你給我的畫時，有那麼一瞬間我真的回到了過去，興沖沖地試驗新的技法。但當畫筆落下的瞬間，我再次清醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做不到......無論再怎麼改變，現在的我沒法去畫任何庸俗的景色，因為我就不是為它們而生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的畫技足夠出色，但我必須畫下更加震撼的景象，完成一幅永垂不朽的傑作，他們才能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕陽......呵，能算得了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從拿起畫筆的那一天起，我就註定要踏上這條路，窮盡一生描繪大地之上最壯麗的景色——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，德夫林先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再次感激你做的一切，畫好你的畫之後，我就會啟程離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您要去追尋下一場天災嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"既然您不需要這些畫稿了，請問我可以帶走它們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你吧，最好把它們都燒掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先行離開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真吵......外面在幹什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好香的味道......很熟悉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩里太太的肉湯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德夫林先生，您醒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......你們在做什......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“搬遷節”呀，是月禾姑娘的“災後心靈互助會”舉辦的，讓大家一起放鬆的節日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的畫可為節日增添了不少藝術氣息呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畫......我的畫？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他抬起頭，看見天空之下飄蕩著的棉線。\n一根棉線連接著兩處房頂，數不清的棉線將許多棚屋連接起來。\n很多張畫稿懸掛在棉線上，嘩啦啦地在風中舞動。\n是他的畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早說了，您的畫那麼漂亮，就該拿出來給大家看，您還不樂意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道那小姑娘怎麼說動您的，但這些畫總算是能被人看見了，真好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......取下來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些垃圾，根本稱不上畫作！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼呀？我喜歡您的畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是你根本不懂畫！要是......要是被他們看到了，就知道有多拙劣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確不懂怎麼看畫，但是您的畫，我是打心底喜歡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且，我可不覺得畫只該給哪些人看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看見您的畫，我就想起了我們的家，可惜已經被天災毀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有些傷心，但是您畫得實在太美了，我忍不住想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是加把勁，早點安定下來，過上安穩的生活，也有時間去周邊逛逛了，說不定能看到像畫裡這麼美的風景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，您不相信我，看看周圍就明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看見了嗎？畫上的白楊樹森林......真希望能在那樣的森林中漫步、野餐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"體貼的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等安定下來了，我一定會找到畫裡這麼美的地方，和你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的幼童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好紅的煎蛋，爸爸，我餓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，那不是煎蛋，是在林間霧氣之中冉冉升起的太陽，太美了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調皮的幼童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太陽，我喜歡太陽！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都被您的畫打動了，喜歡得很呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些日子麻煩事一大堆，又背井離鄉的，換誰心裡都堵得慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"月禾這姑娘忙前忙後，出了不少力，連我的鍋都是她修好的。大家心情能好轉，少不了她的功勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天又為大家舉辦了節日，真不知道該怎麼謝謝她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且聽她說，我還得向您道個歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撤離的時候我把您的畫具全部打包在一起了，弄翻了一些，實在不好意思，想著拿什麼賠禮道歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，您要不要嚐嚐我燉的肉湯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"月禾......佩里太太，您有看見月禾女士在哪裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那姑娘剛才和我講了，說您要是問起來，就去安置點南邊的小山丘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，欸，您別急著去，我還沒說完呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩里太太","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她還說了，現在她不在那裡，您知道什麼時候該去找她，記得帶上畫具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩里太太，請給我來一碗肉湯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要大碗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是這個時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"很高興見到您，德夫林先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我和您講過，這邊風景很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在目之所及的盡頭，一顆巨大的黃色光球正在下沉。\n像一顆碩大無比的心臟，奮力維繫著白晝最後的性命。\n地平線蠶食著它的軀殼，它的每一次搏動，都向大地噴出萬丈霞光。\n但黑夜，黑夜仍襲來如浪潮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"很美吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得離開東國的那天，臨走之時，窗外也是這樣的夕陽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......你要那麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼您不親手將那些畫稿處理掉呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"坐下吧，德夫林先生，我想同您講一個故事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在離這裡很遠的地方，曾經有一個小女孩，生活在一座高山上的神社裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g10_easternhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她出生於一個古老而受人敬仰的家族，生來註定要承擔家族的未來。因此她從小就要學習各種儀式和舞蹈，去見各種各樣的大人物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是她很討厭這些事情，事實上，她討厭一切裝模作樣沒有實際作用的行動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"於是長大以後，她選擇了離開家，成為一名天災信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"她用自己的能力成功幫助了很多居民在天災到來前撤離，卻唯獨少了和家人的交流。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g10_easternhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但有一天，一場天災發生在她的家鄉附近。她成功撤離了範圍內的大部分人，可面對不願離開的家裡人，她卻一點辦法也沒有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"那個時候她才意識到，自己完全不知道怎麼和家裡人交流。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很不可思議吧？明明能說服位高權重的人，但面對最親密的家人卻束手無策，只能眼睜睜看著悲劇發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"悲傷的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"德夫林先生，您知道的，總有一些人拼命向著理想奔跑，卻完全沒有留意身邊的景色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夕陽和天災有所不同，但也並無高下。風景有多麼動人，只在於旅人是否留意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，偶爾也停下來看看，不要錯過當下的風景。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我記起來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那時候，我只是個愛畫畫的孩子。每天傍晚，在酒館最好的位置上描摹夕陽......晚歸的羽獸撒下的羽毛，奔波的人們在晚霞下的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喝酒的工人都喜歡看我畫畫，他們圍著我哈哈大笑，說落日像一個圓圓的煎蛋，我說我要畫個更像的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我從不扔掉畫稿，畫完的稿子會被貼在酒館的牆上，等看上的客人用幾枚硬幣帶走......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那時，我真的很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"後來有一天，萊昂先生站在我的身後，看著我作畫，他說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“孩子，你的畫打動了我。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......現在我還能畫出那樣的畫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這雙望向天災的眼睛，這雙無法拿起畫筆的手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，您還欠我一幅畫呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"就現在吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德夫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"您可以......畫下我的舞蹈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"即將逝去的光芒中，翩然的身姿與晚霞一同旋舞。\n筆觸細密，將這一刻定格為永恆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"真不愧是月禾。這次避難後的居民調查資料，生活滿意度達到了新高，居民心理狀態也都很不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"這下開展後續的遷移工作就方便多了，希望居民們能早日適應移動城市裡的新生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"真是不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，這就是每次月禾都要在天災之後留下來的理由嗎？幫助當地居民走出天災後的心理困境，有動力面對新的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，畢竟脫離危險不是萬事大吉，恢復好心情去生活也很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說這一次你還幫助了一位畫家，他寄回萊塔尼亞的新作得到了著名畫家萊昂大師的讚賞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那個大師似乎有十幾年都沒有點評過作品了，這件事因而在藝術界引發了轟動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我還聽說，現在有好幾場他的獨立畫展已經在籌備中了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，他畫得本來就很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"如實交代，這次你是不是又講了新的小女孩故事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"猜猜看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"猜不到......反正不管什麼樣的故事，月禾講出來都像真的一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我還是好奇，月禾第一次選擇在天災後留下來的時候，是怎麼考慮的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......很討厭悲傷，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，別耽誤時間了。不是還有任務在等著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，這次月禾你又有得忙了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","aliases":["月禾"]}]}
